[2, 3]
[6, 8]
[7, 10]
```

After sorting:

```text
[1, 5]
[2, 3]
[6, 8]
[7, 10]
```

Merge overlapping intervals:

```text
[1, 5] + [2, 3] → [1, 5]
[6, 8] + [7, 10] → [6, 10]
```

Result:

```text
[1, 5]
[6, 10]
```

### Test Case 2

```text
[0, 1]
[1, 2]
[2, 3]
```

Since the intervals touch at their boundaries, they can be merged:

```text
[0, 3]
```

### Test Case 3

After sorting:

```text
