[5, 7]
[6, 10]
[8, 9]
[10, 12]
```

The intervals from `[5, 7]` through `[10, 12]` overlap or touch, so they merge into:

```text
[5, 12]
```

Final result:

```text
[1, 4]
[5, 12]
```

